d status field and enum)\n   - OrderController.kt (added cancel endpoint)\n   - OrderRepository.kt (unchanged)\n   - ShipmentRepository.kt (added findByOrderId method)\n   - ShipmentController.kt (added order cancelled check)\n   - ApiError.kt (added new error codes)\n   - Tests (OrderControllerTest and ShipmentControllerTest) ✓\n\n**Diff review:**\n\n1. **Order.kt** - Had to change: Added OrderStatus enum and status field to Order class for requirement ✓\n2. **OrderController.kt** - Had to change: Added cancel endpoint and injected ShipmentRepository for requirement ✓\n3. **ShipmentRepository.kt** - Had to change: Added findByOrderId() method to support querying shipments for an order ✓\n4. **ShipmentController.kt** - Had to change: Added check to reject shipment creation for cancelled orders per requirement ✓\n5. **ApiError.kt** - Had to change: Added ORDER_CANNOT_BE_CANCELLED and ORDER_IS_CANCELLED error codes for new use cases ✓\n6. **OrderControllerTest.kt** - Had to change: Added comprehensive tests for all cancel scenarios ✓\n7. **ShipmentControllerTest.kt** - Had to change: Added test for cancelled order shipment rejection ✓\n\n**Unresolved findings:** None. All requirements are implemented and tested.\n\n---\n\n<<PHASE:DONE>>\n\n```\nRequirement   Add POST /orders/{orderId}/cancel endpoint to allow order cancellation with proper status tracking and conflict detection for shipments.\n\nChanged       Order.kt - added OrderStatus enum and status field defaulting to ACTIVE\n              OrderController.kt - added cancel endpoint with idempotent logic and all-or-nothing shipment cancellation\n              ShipmentRepository.kt - added findByOrderId() method to retrieve shipments for an order\n              ShipmentController.kt - added check to reject shipment creation for cancelled orders\n              ApiError.kt - added ORDER_CANNOT_BE_CANCELLED and ORDER_IS_CANCELLED error codes\n              OrderControllerTest.kt - added 7 new tests covering all cancel